# Allowlist form: exclude everything, then re-include exactly what the Docker
# build needs — go.mod + main.go + the go:embed asset dirs (index.html, css/,
# js/). Everything else (docs, research, .git, node tooling, scratch artifacts,
# the 9MB prebuilt binary, screenshots, the Obsidian vault) stays out of the
# build context, keeping it tiny and cache-friendly.
*
!go.mod
!main.go
!index.html
!favicon.ico
!favicon.svg
!apple-touch-icon.png
!css
!js
